Spørgsmål: Lav en liste af bøger, med title og publisher name, hvor at publisher er fra london og bøgens title starter med ”Harry”.
SELECT b.title, p.name, p.city FROM Books b JOIN Book_Publishers bp ON b.book_id = bp.book_id JOIN Publishers p ON bp.publisher_id = p.publisher_id WHERE p.city = "London" AND b.title LIKE "Harry%" ORDER BY b.title, p.name; 

Database: Library
Spørgsmål: Hvis medlems navn og by HVIS de har en resevation hvor at bogens publishers navn indeholder ”Press” og medlemmet navn indeholder ”e”.
SELECT DISTINCT CONCAT(m.first_name, ' ', m.last_name) AS member_name, m.city FROM Members m JOIN Reservations r ON r.member_id = m.member_id JOIN Books b ON b.book_id = r.book_id JOIN Book_Publishers bp ON bp.book_id = b.book_id JOIN Publishers p ON p.publisher_id = bp.publisher_id WHERE p.name LIKE '%Press%' AND CONCAT(m.first_name, ' ', m.last_name) LIKE '%e%' ORDER BY m.first_name, m.last_name; 

